Lumi production_resource_not_found：设定资产不存在 资源不存在或不属于当前项目。
调用修正规则与 schema：
{"tool":{"name":"settings","description":"List/get/create/update/soft-delete text settings (character, scene, prop, reference); artwork is optional. Create uses premise.revision from list; edits use item.revision. select_image selects an existing variant_uuid using the target's current expected_revision; For a conversation candidate number, get with include_versions=true to read a paged identity-only image_versions manifest, match version_no, then select with the returned revision.","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"allOf":[{"if":{"properties":{"action":{"const":"create"}}},"then":{"required":["asset_type","title","summary","expected_revision"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"action":{"const":"delete"}}},"then":{"required":["setting_uuid","expected_revision"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"action":{"const":"get"}}},"then":{"required":["setting_uuid"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"action":{"const":"update"}}},"then":{"required":["setting_uuid","expected_revision"]}},{"if":{"properties":{"action":{"enum":["select_image"],"type":"string"}}},"then":{"required":["setting_uuid","variant_uuid","expected_revision"]}}],"properties":{"action":{"enum":["list","get","create","update","delete","select_image"],"type":"string"},"after":{"description":"next_cursor from the previous response.","pattern":"^[0-9]{1,10}$","type":"string"},"asset_type":{"enum":["character","scene","prop","reference"],"type":"string"},"before":{"description":"Return a page before this cursor; mutually exclusive with after.","pattern":"^[0-9]{1,10}$","type":"string"},"expected_revision":{"description":"Exact revision from the last read or render_prompt; required for every mutation.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"include_versions":{"type":"boolean"},"limit":{"description":"List size, default 20; reduce if result_too_large.","maximum":100,"minimum":1,"type":"integer"},"setting_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"summary":{"description":"Full text description, up to 12000 characters.","maxLength":120000,"type":"string"},"tags":{"items":{"description":"Search tag.","maxLength":120000,"type":"string"},"maxItems":50,"type":"array"},"title":{"description":"Setting title.","maxLength":120000,"type":"string"},"variant_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"}},"required":["action"],"type":"object"}},"rules":["只使用本目录工具与 JSON 对象参数。UUID 必须来自当前项目读取，不能使用内部 id。","版本冲突时保留已有内容，重读目标后再判断；取消、超时或 result_unknown 后先核对状态，禁止自动重写。","列表使用 cursor_pagination；result_too_large 时减小 limit 或上下文范围，不截断正文。完整流程见当前插件 authoring/MANUAL.md。","list/get 只读。create 使用 list 的 premise.revision；update/delete/select_image 使用目标 revision。select_image 是写入。setting_boards 仅 list/get；总览图由 receive_media(slot=setting_board) 导入。apply_setting_breakdown 是原子写入，使用批次与 premise 两级 revision；同键原参数重放返回原结果。"],"discovery":{"tool":"list_tools","args":{"category":"settings"}}}

Lumi asset_not_found：Asset 不存在 该 Asset 不属于当前项目或已进入回收站。
调用修正规则与 schema：
{"tool":{"name":"read_image","description":"Read a project Asset UUID as a bounded MCP image for review or host generation reference. Use settings/pages get to obtain current_variant.asset.uuid or current_image.asset.uuid. For page generation use prepare_page_image and the host viewer on its returned collage path instead of reading individual settings. This tool remains for setting artwork and review.","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"asset_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"max_edge":{"description":"Preview longest edge, default 1024; may shrink further to bound content size.","maximum":1024,"minimum":256,"type":"integer"}},"required":["asset_uuid"],"type":"object"}},"rules":["只使用本目录工具与 JSON 对象参数。UUID 必须来自当前项目读取，不能使用内部 id。","版本冲突时保留已有内容，重读目标后再判断；取消、超时或 result_unknown 后先核对状态，禁止自动重写。","列表使用 cursor_pagination；result_too_large 时减小 limit 或上下文范围，不截断正文。完整流程见当前插件 authoring/MANUAL.md。","设定先 image_target；页面先 prepare_page_image 获取完整提示词、同一完整合图与 preparation。原生引擎显式使用正式参考参数及 reference_image_path；Core 使用 status=ready 的 full_collage reference_media_url，先实际查看合图，再按本次 Guide 明确传图。status=failed 表示 Core 交接失败，未提交生图；不得用预览图/路径冒充，也不切付费 pipeline。none 模式不传参考。总览图生成后用 receive_media(slot=setting_board)，单项设定/页面用对应 slot；均在 ghost_call.attachments 交接恰好一张图，不在 args 中自报路径、指纹、字节或 session。call_tool 不能代替附件入口。","单图最多 20 MiB；PNG/JPEG/WebP，完整解码最多 4000 万像素。默认 keep，可选 crop/pad 并保留原图历史。冲突或结果未知先重读目标，不自动重新生成或覆盖。","read_image 返回最长边不超过 1024、JPEG 不超过 120 KiB 的受控参考图。Core 使用返回的 reference_media_url；引擎原生生图使用刚读到的对话参考图。寄存预览成功不代表编辑成功，也不能证明订阅额度来源。"],"discovery":{"tool":"list_tools","args":{"category":"media"}}}

