{"tool":{"name":"prepare_page_image","description":"Prepare host page artwork without a provider: explicitly select up to 12 active setting_uuids in label order ([] means no references). Every selected setting requires a passed setting_reviews entry bound to its current variant/revision and style_digest, with reference_basis and concrete comparison. Missing/failed/stale reviews are rejected; the server verifies the record, not visual similarity. Lumi reads current images and composes a fresh labeled PNG in system temporary storage, never a project Asset/cache. Returns reference_image_path (real absolute path, empty for none), ordered versioned sources, generation_prompt, image_write_back and signed preparation with digest. Use the host image viewer to read ONLY that returned path, then imagegen referenced_image_paths=[that same path] (omit references for none). Do not read source assets, rewrite references, append to the prompt, or invoke a provider pipeline. Immediately import the host output with the EXACT generation_prompt and unchanged preparation. Changed page/settings/prompts require preparing, viewing and generating again.","input_schema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"additional_direction":{"maxLength":12000,"type":"string"},"page_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"setting_reviews":{"description":"Host visual assessments of the selected current images. Read image_target for style_digest and image versions. Compare originals and explicit user requirements; record concrete differences or agreement, not just 'checked'. No-reference selection uses [] or omits this field.","items":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"comparison":{"maxLength":2000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"expected_revision":{"description":"Exact revision from the last read or render_prompt; required for every mutation.","minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"reference_basis":{"maxLength":2000,"minLength":1,"type":"string"},"setting_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"style_digest":{"pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{64}$","type":"string"},"variant_uuid":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"verdict":{"enum":["passed","needs_revision"],"type":"string"}},"required":["setting_uuid","variant_uuid","expected_revision","style_digest","verdict","reference_basis","comparison"],"type":"object"},"maxItems":12,"type":"array"},"setting_uuids":{"description":"Explicit current-project active settings in collage label order. [] means a real no-reference generation; omitted/null is invalid.","items":{"description":"Public UUIDv7 from a previous read.","pattern":"^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-7[0-9a-f]{3}-[89ab][0-9a-f]{3}-[0-9a-f]{12}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":12,"type":"array","uniqueItems":true}},"required":["page_uuid","setting_uuids"],"type":"object"}},"rules":["只使用本目录工具与 JSON 对象参数。UUID 必须来自当前项目读取，不能使用内部 id。","版本冲突时保留已有内容，重读目标后再判断；取消、超时或 result_unknown 后先核对状态，禁止自动重写。","列表使用 cursor_pagination；result_too_large 时减小 limit 或上下文范围，不截断正文。完整流程见当前插件 authoring/MANUAL.md。","设定先 image_target；页面先 prepare_page_image 获取完整提示词、同一完整合图与 preparation。原生引擎显式使用正式参考参数及 reference_image_path；Core 使用 status=ready 的 full_collage reference_media_url，先实际查看合图，再按本次 Guide 明确传图。status=failed 表示 Core 交接失败，未提交生图；不得用预览图/路径冒充，也不切付费 pipeline。none 模式不传参考。总览图生成后用 receive_media(slot=setting_board)，单项设定/页面用对应 slot；均在 ghost_call.attachments 交接恰好一张图，不在 args 中自报路径、指纹、字节或 session。call_tool 不能代替附件入口。","单图最多 20 MiB；PNG/JPEG/WebP，完整解码最多 4000 万像素。默认 keep，可选 crop/pad 并保留原图历史。冲突或结果未知先重读目标，不自动重新生成或覆盖。","read_image 返回最长边不超过 1024、JPEG 不超过 120 KiB 的受控参考图。Core 使用返回的 reference_media_url；引擎原生生图使用刚读到的对话参考图。寄存预览成功不代表编辑成功，也不能证明订阅额度来源。"],"discovery":{"tool":"list_tools","args":{"category":"media"}}}
